{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14243","headline":"奉贺太保岐公承恩致政 · 窦常","name":"奉贺太保岐公承恩致政","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君爲宫保及清时，冠盖初闲拜武迟。\n五色诏中宣九德，百僚班外置三师。\n山泉遂性休称疾，子弟能官各受词。\n不学铸金思范蠡，乞言犹许上丹墀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦常","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14243.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14243","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}